勾选后问医生时，只把勾选行交给 `buildTicketDrugs`：

```164:167:src/screens/shopping-cart-screen/shopping-cart-screen.tsx
  const handleConsultDoctor = (): void => {
    const bookingDrugs = buildTicketDrugs(
      (cartItemInfo ?? []).filter((item) => item.selected === true),
    );
```

拼装逻辑在 `ticket-drugs.ts`。这一行没有现成的 `ingredients` 数组，所以用 `activeIngredients`：

```65:73:src/screens/doctor-detail-screen/ticket-drugs.ts
const toIngredients = (lineItem: Record<string, unknown>): string[] => {
  const source = Array.isArray(lineItem.ingredients)
    ? lineItem.ingredients
